            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Updates

- Installing an update on an organisation-managed Mac no longer starts the
  five-minute emergency-quit countdown. Kahf Guard now recognises the
  updater's own request to quit and steps aside for it, however long the
  install takes to get there.
]]></description>
